	// HYPOTHESIS-3: Combined improvements will achieve combined_score > -3850
	// MECHANISM-3: Reducing load_spikes by ~60ms and P95 by ~35ms should improve combined score by ~47 points.
	// EXPECT-3: combined_score > -3850

